OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fmostly clear skies, leading to a
OL,7,Fchilly night with light winds. A grass
OL,8,Ffrost is possible by dawn for any
OL,9,Fprone rural spots.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA bright start, but cloud
OL,12,Fbuilding in the west with a few spots
OL,13,Fof rain possible across the Peak
OL,14,FDistrict in the afternoon. Sunny
OL,15,Fspells elsewhere through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
