OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud and sunny spells
OL,7,FTuesday. Outbreaks of rain expected
OL,8,Ffor a time Wednesday, occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy. Fine and sunny Thursday. Warm
OL,10,Fby day, but chilly Wednesday and
OL,11,FThursday nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
